             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/CvssModifiedImpact#NOT_DEFINED> ] ? ;
          cve:modifiedSubIntegrityImpact [ <https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/CvssV4ModifiedSubsequentImpact#NONE>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/CvssV4ModifiedSubsequentImpact#LOW>
